TI  - GP perspectives on a psychiatry phone line in Western Australia's Great Southern region: implications for addressing rural GP workload
T2  - AUSTRALIAN JOURNAL OF PRIMARY HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - evaluation
KW  - GP workload
KW  - patient complexity
KW  - primary care
KW  - psychiatry advice service
