TI  - National Ambulance Surveillance System: A novel method using coded Australian ambulance clinical records to monitor self-harm and mental health-related morbidity
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - SUICIDE ATTEMPTS
KW  - IDEATION
KW  - PRESENTATIONS
KW  - CAPACITY
KW  - VICTORIA
