TI  - Characterization of pesticide exposures and their associations with asthma morbidity in a predominantly low-income urban pediatric cohort in Baltimore City
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Pesticides
KW  - Respiratory health
