TI  - General practitioners' and out-of-hours doctors' role as gatekeeper in emergency admissions to somatic hospitals in Norway: registry-based observational study
T2  - BMC HEALTH SERVICES RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Norway
KW  - General practitioners
KW  - After-hours care
KW  - Out-of-hours medical care
