TI  - Integrated serum metabolomics, 16S rRNA sequencing and bile acid profiling to reveal the potential mechanism of gentiopicroside against nonalcoholic steatohepatitis in lean mice
T2  - JOURNAL OF ETHNOPHARMACOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Gentiopicroside
KW  - Lean nonalcoholic steatohepatitis
