TI  - Effectiveness of the CardioPain initiative in reducing inappropriate NSAID prescriptions in pain therapy among high cardiovascular risk patients: an informative Italian survey
T2  - HEART INTERNATIONAL
LA  - English
KW  - Inappropriate prescription
KW  - NSAIDs
KW  - Cardiovascular risk
KW  - Questionnaire
KW  - NONSTEROIDAL ANTIINFLAMMATORY DRUGS
KW  - METAANALYSIS
