TI  - Blue light phones as potential locations for deploying public access naloxone kits on a college campus
T2  - JOURNAL OF AMERICAN COLLEGE HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Geospatial analysis
KW  - opioid overdose
KW  - public health
