TI  - Surface hydroxylation of polyethylene by plasma polymerization of allyl alcohol and subsequent silylation
T2  - COLLOIDS AND SURFACES A-PHYSICOCHEMICAL AND ENGINEERING ASPECTS
LA  - English
KW  - plasma polymerization
