TI  - On Smartphone Sensability of Bi-Phasic User Intoxication Levels from Diverse Walk Types in Standardized Field Sobriety Tests
T2  - 2019 41ST ANNUAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE OF THE IEEE ENGINEERING IN MEDICINE AND BIOLOGY SOCIETY (EMBC)
