TI  - Spatial heterogeneity and socioeconomic determinants of opioid prescribing in England between 2015 and 2018
T2  - BMC MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - Opioid crisis
KW  - Prescribing data
KW  - Spatial analysis
KW  - Public health
KW  - ABUSE
