TI  - Prevalence and Patterns of Off-Label Transmucosal Immediate-Release Fentanyl Use in French General Practice: A Mixed-Methods Study Based on a Voluntary Online Survey
T2  - PAIN AND THERAPY
LA  - English
KW  - Transmucosal immediate-release fentanyl
KW  - Fentanyl
