TI  - Psychometric evaluation of the "SmoCess-GP" measure. A patient-based questionnaire to assess smoking cessation counselling in general practice
T2  - PRAVENTION UND GESUNDHEITSFORDERUNG
LA  - English
KW  - Checklist
KW  - Smoking cessation
KW  - Secondary preventive care
KW  - General practitioner
KW  - Psychometric evaluation
