TI  - A randomized, Phase IIb study investigating oliceridine (TRV130), a novel μ-receptor G-protein pathway selective (μ-GPS) modulator, for the management of moderate to severe acute pain following abdominoplasty
T2  - JOURNAL OF PAIN RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - TRV130
KW  - acute pain
