TI  - How do general practitioners put preventive care recommendations into practice? A cross-sectional study in Switzerland and France
T2  - BMJ OPEN
LA  - English
KW  - UNITED-STATES
KW  - RISK
KW  - SERVICES
KW  - ADULTS
