TI  - Diagnostics and treatment of acute non-specific low back pain: do physicians follow the guidelines?
T2  - SWISS MEDICAL WEEKLY
LA  - English
KW  - CLINICAL-PRACTICE GUIDELINES
KW  - HEALTH-CARE
KW  - MANAGEMENT
KW  - BELIEFS
