TI  - Trends in management of hip and knee osteoarthritis in general practice in Australia over an 11-year window: a nationwide cross-sectional survey
T2  - LANCET REGIONAL HEALTH-WESTERN PACIFIC
LA  - English
KW  - osteoarthritis
