TI  - Driving under the influence of prescribed opioids: a qualitative study of the pharmacist's contribution to road safety
T2  - JOURNAL OF PHARMACY PRACTICE AND RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - opioids
KW  - driving
KW  - pharmacist practice
KW  - road safety
KW  - INFORMATION
