TI  - An examination of the influences on New South Wales general practitioners regarding the provision of opioid substitution therapy
T2  - DRUG AND ALCOHOL REVIEW
LA  - English
KW  - general practitioners
KW  - opioid substitution therapy
KW  - dependency
KW  - pain
