TI  - Recommendations for implementing digital alcohol interventions in primary care: lessons learned from a Norwegian feasibility study
T2  - FRONTIERS IN HEALTH SERVICES
LA  - English
KW  - risky drinking
KW  - hazardous drinking
KW  - alcohol
