TI  - Guideline adherence in the management of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder in children: An audit of selected medical records in three Australian states
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - DEFICIT/HYPERACTIVITY DISORDER
KW  - PRIMARY-CARE
