TI  - Perception of preventive care and readiness for lifestyle change in rural and urban patients in Poland: a questionnaire study
T2  - ANNALS OF AGRICULTURAL AND ENVIRONMENTAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - general practice
KW  - patients
