TI  - Prevalence of Airflow Limitation in Patients Diagnosed and Treated for Symptoms of Chronic Bronchitis by General Practitioners in Tochigi Prefecture, Japan
T2  - INTERNAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - chronic bronchitis
