TI  - Quit in General Practice: a cluster randomised trial of enhanced in-practice support for smoking cessation
T2  - BMC FAMILY PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - CORONARY-HEART-DISEASE
KW  - SECONDARY PREVENTION
KW  - ADVICE
KW  - INTERVENTIONS
KW  - MANAGEMENT
KW  - READINESS
