TI  - What are older smokers' attitudes to quitting and how are they managed in primary care? An analysis of the cross-sectional English Smoking Toolkit Study
T2  - BMJ OPEN
LA  - English
KW  - CESSATION INTERVENTIONS
KW  - AGED 50
