TI  - Understanding Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease Management and Treatment Patterns in General Medicine: Results From the ASTER Study in Italy
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF CHRONIC OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY DISEASE
LA  - English
KW  - long-acting beta2-agonist/muscarinic antagonist
KW  - lung function
