AB  - This paper describes an automatic information, alarm and tracking system that could provide a real time solution for the security of the employees who use the cab (transport) facility provided by the company. The system can be used in any investigation related services or places where knowing the whereabouts of a person is very important. As the system is incorporated with an alcohol sensor, it provides solution to drunken driving as well. At the same time, employer can keep track of the current location of the cab, employee's pick up and drop off points and check whether driver is deviating from the actual route. Visual vigilance is kept on the cab by monitoring it using a android camera installed inside the cab.
