TI  - Adherence to antiretroviral therapy among cisgender gay, bisexual and other men who have sex with men in Brazil: Evaluating the role of HIV-related stigma dimensions
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - INTERACTIVE TOXICITY BELIEFS
KW  - ALCOHOL-USE DISORDERS
KW  - SUBSTANCE-USE
KW  - MEDICATION ADHERENCE
KW  - VIROLOGICAL FAILURE
