TI  - Smart Bi-eBikes (SBB): A low cost UGV solution for precision agriculture applications
T2  - AUTONOMOUS AIR AND GROUND SENSING SYSTEMS FOR AGRICULTURAL OPTIMIZATION AND PHENOTYPING VII
LA  - English
CP  - Conference on Autonomous Air and Ground Sensing Systems for Agricultural Optimization and Phenotyping VII
