TI  - From present to prosperity: assessing the current status and envisioning opportunities in the industrial-scale cultivation of Haematococcus pluvialis for astaxanthin production
T2  - PHYTOCHEMISTRY REVIEWS
LA  - English
KW  - Haematococcus pluvialis
KW  - Industrial-scale cultivation
KW  - Microalgae
KW  - Natural astaxanthin
