TI  - Tele-ECG consulting and outcomes on primary care patients in a low-to-middle income population: the first experience from Makassar telemedicine program, Indonesia
T2  - BMC FAMILY PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - Telemedicine
KW  - Tele-ECG
KW  - Primary care
KW  - Low
KW  - and middle-income country
KW  - Quality of care
