TI  - THE MEDICAL PROFILE OF UNIDENTIFIED PROBLEM DRINKERS IN GENERAL-PRACTICE - TEST OF AN HYPOTHESIS
T2  - ALCOHOL AND ALCOHOLISM
LA  - English
KW  - ALCOHOLISM SCREENING-TEST
KW  - EARLY IDENTIFICATION
KW  - CAGE QUESTIONNAIRE
KW  - ABUSE
