TI  - The combination of plasma fibrinogen and neutrophil lymphocyte ratio (F-NLR) is a predictive factor in patients with resectable non small cell lung cancer
T2  - JOURNAL OF CELLULAR PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - fibrinogen
