TI  - Alcohol use disorders in Europe: A comparison of general population and primary health care prevalence rates
T2  - JOURNAL OF SUBSTANCE USE
LA  - English
KW  - Alcohol use disorders
KW  - prevalence
KW  - primary health care
KW  - MENTAL-DISORDERS
KW  - SUBSTANCE USE
