TI  - Mental Health Care System Optimization from a Health-Economics Perspective: Where to Sow and Where to Reap?
T2  - JOURNAL OF MENTAL HEALTH POLICY AND ECONOMICS
LA  - English
KW  - COGNITIVE-BEHAVIOR THERAPY
KW  - COST-EFFECTIVENESS
KW  - DEPRESSIVE-DISORDERS
KW  - PROBLEM DRINKERS
