TI  - EXPLICIT: a feasibility study of remote expert elicitation in health technology assessment
T2  - BMC MEDICAL INFORMATICS AND DECISION MAKING
LA  - English
KW  - Expert elicitation
KW  - Probability distributions
KW  - Elicitation tool
KW  - Email elicitation
