TI  - Do general practitioners record alcohol abuse in the electronic medical records? A comparison of survey and medical record data
T2  - CURRENT MEDICAL RESEARCH AND OPINION
LA  - English
KW  - Alcohol abuse
KW  - diagnoses
KW  - general practice
KW  - USE DISORDERS
