TI  - Influence of patient characteristics on doctors' questioning and lifestyle advice for coronary heart disease: a UK/US video experiment
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF GENERAL PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - coronary heart disease
KW  - primary health care
KW  - risk factors
KW  - smoking
KW  - INEQUALITIES
