TI  - 'If you can't see a dilemma in this situation you should probably regard it as a warning': a metasynthesis and theoretical modelling of general practitioners' opioid prescription experiences in primary care
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF PAIN
LA  - English
KW  - Chronic pain
KW  - family medicine
KW  - general practitioner
KW  - opioid
KW  - prescribing metasynthesis
KW  - QUALITATIVE EVIDENCE SYNTHESIS
